# behavior: an alias of a module member, public or private, calls the member it names (#1764)
# retires: loaves/compiler/incan_emit/src/codegen.rs::top_level_qualified_alias_preserves_target_path
# retires: loaves/compiler/incan_ir/src/lower/tests/import_paths.rs::module_member_alias_lowers_to_an_import_of_the_member_issue1764
# expect-stdout:
